{
 "source": "0x020EE04C, read directly from arm9_section_0_02000000.bin",
 "mechanism": "Locomotion CLASS byte per ANIMATION STATE, indexed state*2. Read at 0x02004BE8 (ldrb r1,[r1, r5, lsl #1]) where r5 is the animation state from actor+0x182. The caller then branches at 0x02004BEC/BF4/BFC: class 0 -> descriptor+0x20 (WALK), class 1 -> descriptor+0x24 (RUN), class 2 -> speed 0 (locked).",
 "direction": "THE ANIMATION DECIDES THE SPEED. The port had it inverted - it computed a speed and then chose an animation from it. 0x02004B88 is vtable slot +0x3C on the actor and is invoked from PLAYER_TICK at 0x020074D0 with the animation state as its argument.",
 "note": "States 2/3/4 (jumpUp/jumpFall/fall) are class 1, so the DS holds RUN speed while airborne.",
